# Legibility (the check of report 054) on zero8's 3.5" 480x320 panel (6.3 px/mm), landscape and PDA mode: zoom 17, display
# scale auto (the engine's choice at 6.3 px/mm: 1.5x).
title Legibility zero8: zoom 17, scale auto
sizes 480x320 320x480
ppmm 630
env DECKATLAS_DEMO 1
env DECKATLAS_SCALE auto
env DECKATLAS_VIEW 48.88007,2.263184,17

wait 3000
shot zero8-z17-auto
key esc
expect quit
